{"4220880": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Starfall Deck", "steam_appid": 4220880, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/bb5707a60bc3212fff60afcd16daf6d1.poster.avif?t=1764711241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/bb5707a60bc3212fff60afcd16daf6d1.webm?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/bb5707a60bc3212fff60afcd16daf6d1.mp4?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Starfall Deck</strong> is a <strong>Rogue-lite City Builder</strong> where your deck is your city.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >On a hostile alien planet, you must build upwards to survive. Your colony is fragile, your resources are scarce, and your only currency is <strong>Hope</strong>.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Build Your Deck, Build Your City</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Forget traditional construction menus. In Starfall Deck, your buildings are your cards, and your strategy is your deck.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Card-Based Construction:</strong> Every module, upgrade, and emergency action is drawn from your deck.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Manage Your Aetherium:</strong> Use your limited Aetherium energy during the <strong>Night Phase</strong> to play cards. Will you build a Fusion Reactor for power, or a Hydroponic Unit for food?</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Vertical Expansion:</strong> Space is limited. You must build vertically, stacking modules on a grid to maximize efficiency and adjacency bonuses.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/144a11de94c937c3b0e45964b9a1b90e.poster.avif?t=1764711241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/144a11de94c937c3b0e45964b9a1b90e.webm?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/144a11de94c937c3b0e45964b9a1b90e.mp4?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Survive the Unforgiving Cycle</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The game operates on a tight Day/Night cycle where every decision has consequences.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Day Phase (Observation):</strong> Watch your colony run. If your Energy or Life Support (Oxygen, Water, Heat) runs into a deficit, your colony's Hope will plummet.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Night Phase (Action):</strong> This is your time to react. Draw your hand, deploy new modules, and fix critical failures before the sun rises.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>The Threat of Hope:</strong> Hope is your health bar. If it hits 0%, the colony falls.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Weather the Storm</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The planet is alive and it wants you gone. The <strong>Atmospheric Instability</strong> meter is always ticking.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Disasters:</strong> Prepare for Ion Storms, Acid Rain, and Meteor Showers. Build Shield Generators to protect your tower or suffer structural damage.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Random Events:</strong> Adapt to fluctuating conditions. A &quot;Dense Fog&quot; might reduce card draw, while an &quot;Ion Rain&quot; might cheapen your energy costs.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/4458814fcb3614f98d9dc28e1758e0b0.poster.avif?t=1764711241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/4458814fcb3614f98d9dc28e1758e0b0.webm?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/4458814fcb3614f98d9dc28e1758e0b0.mp4?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Rebuild and Adapt</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Failure is just a stepping stone.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Meta-Progression:</strong> Earn <strong>Reputation Points</strong> after every run based on your population and survival time.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Unlock the Legacy:</strong> Visit the &quot;Legacy Terminal&quot; to unlock new card blueprints, powerful starting bonuses, and unique Tower Leaders with special abilities.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Add to Wishlist</h2>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/bb5707a60bc3212fff60afcd16daf6d1.poster.avif?t=1764711241\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4220880/extras/bb5707a60bc3212fff60afcd16daf6d1.webm?t=1764711241\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/stea